  "Fuentes y riesgos, a la vista.": "Sources and risks in view.",
  "Explora inmuebles, deuda, fondos, acciones y oro. Documentamos": "Explore property, debt, funds, equities and gold. We document",
  "qué entidad opera, qué permisos constan y qué condiciones publica": "which entity operates, what permissions are recorded and what terms it publishes",
  ". Cada ficha señala lo contrastado y lo que no hemos podido verificar. Estar en el radar no es una recomendación ni confirma que puedas invertir.": ". Each entry states what has been checked and what we could not verify. Being on the radar is not a recommendation and does not confirm that you can invest.",
